<title>USA: TABLE - Smithfield Foods Q1 oper shr up.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Smithfield Foods Q1 oper shr up.</headline>
<dateline>NORFOLK, Va. 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>SMITHFIELD FOODS, INC. AND SUBSIDIARIES</p>
<p>						     Thirteen Weeks Ended</p>
<p>							   Jul 27,  Jul 28,</p>
<p> (In thousands, except per share data)	   1997	1996</p>
<p> Sales						  $914,963 $892,870</p>
<p> Nonrecurring charge (A)			    12,600	 --</p>
<p> Income (loss) before income taxes	     (3,690)    1,161</p>
<p> Income taxes					    2,851	415</p>
<p> Net income (loss) (A)			     (6,541)	746</p>
<p>Net income (loss) available to common stockholders</p>
<p>							   (6,541)	408</p>
<p> Net income (loss) per common share (A)	  (.33)	.02</p>
<p> Weighted average common shares outstanding   19,792   18,604</p>
<p>NOTE: (A) The nonrecurring charge of $12.6 million ($0.64 per share) reflects the civil penalties imposed against the company by the U.S. District Court in a civil action brought by the U.S. Environmental Protection Agency. The company has previously announced that the Court's judgment will be appealed.</p>
<p>Net income in the quarter ended July 27, 1997, excluding the nonrecurring charge, increased to $6.1 million, or $0.31 per share, up from $746,000, or $0.02 per share, in the same quarter a year ago.</p>
</text>
